    y=1538 'MODEL · 范文'
    y=1574 'On Tuesday, November 3, our family watched the election results at home. We ate'
    y=1603.82 'pizza, because nobody wanted to cook on such a night. On television, the map'
    y=1633.6399999999999 'changed colour, state by state, and my father said : « Ohio is too close to call ! » I'
    y=1663.4599999999998 'did not understand every state, but I understood the pizza and the excitement. On'
    y=1693.2799999999997 'Sunday night, the clocks had fallen back, so I slept one hour more. It was a long'
    y=1723.0999999999997 'night, and a very American one.'
